Template: homelab-domain-admin/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-domain-admin/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-domain-admin/api_base
Type: string
Default: http://localhost:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable:
 Written into config.yml's homelab_api.base_url — every request this
 app handles is authenticated by introspecting the caller's JWT here.

Template: homelab-domain-admin/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2511
Description: Port for homelab-domain-admin to listen on:

Template: homelab-domain-admin/pdns_api_host
Type: string
Default: 127.0.0.1
Description: Host where PowerDNS's own HTTP API is (or will be) reachable:
 Written into config.yml's powerdns.api_base_url. This package enables
 that API itself (see README.md) if PowerDNS is installed locally —
 only change this from 127.0.0.1 if PowerDNS runs on a different host.

Template: homelab-domain-admin/pdns_api_port
Type: string
Default: 8081
Description: Port for PowerDNS's own HTTP API:
